# vtium's capability list: NAME STATUS ISSUE ROWS NOTE, for the C reference's
# run.py (tests/capabilities/README.md in aaronsb/kmscon), which reads
# NAME STATUS ISSUE and takes the rest as the note.
# works: the probe must pass. missing: it must fail, and ISSUE is the
# vtium/vtium issue that owes the capability. A missing probe that starts
# passing fails the run until it is set to works.
# ROWS: the ADR-1000 rows the probe judges, comma-separated, from which
# COVERAGE.md takes the tests that guard it (tools/conformance/README.md).

# text and attributes
sgr-colon-subparams           works   -     sgr.extended-colour            colon sub-parameters: SGR reads them, other sequences with them are ignored
sgr-underline-styles          works   -     sgr.underline-style            SGR 4:1 to 4:5 and 21 set each underline style, 24 clears
sgr-underline-colour          works   -     sgr.underline-colour           SGR 58;2, 58:2::r:g:b and 59; 4;58;5;196 never blinks
sgr-strike                    works   -     sgr.strike                     SGR 9 and 29
sgr-blink                     works   -     sgr.blink                      SGR 5 and 25 set the frame's blink flag
sgr-italic                    works   -     sgr.italic                     SGR 3 and 23
sgr-truecolor                 works   -     sgr.extended-colour            SGR 38;2 and 48;2
sgr-overline                  missing #37   sgr.overline                   SGR 53 and 55: vtium-term keeps the attribute, and interface 1 reserves its key
sgr-super-subscript           missing #37   sgr.script                     SGR 73 to 75: vtium-term keeps the attribute, and interface 1 reserves its keys
palette-at-draw               works   -     sgr.draw-time-colour           colours are resolved at draw time: a palette change recolours text
modkeys-not-sgr               works   -     input.modify-other-keys        CSI > 4;1 m and CSI ? 4 m are not SGR 4
cluster                       works   -     text.grapheme                  a grapheme cluster is one cell whose codepoints read back
mode-2027                     works   -     DEC-2027                       mode 2027 and its DECRQM reply
vs16-width                    works   -     text.vs-width                  VS16 widens U+2764 to two cells under mode 2027
wide-at-margin                works   -     text.vs-width                  a wide character wraps whole at the margin
rep                           works   -     text.rep                       REP repeats the last printed character, a wide one whole
erase-colours-only            works   -     ctl.bce                        EL, SU, SD and RI blanks take the pen background only
frame-age-per-caller          works   -     platform.multi-monitor         each frame-since caller keeps its own changes
reflow                        missing #41   text.reflow                    a resize rewraps the lines a wrap made
bidi                          missing #43   text.bidi                      placeholder in the probes: no bidirectional reordering

# modes and replies
mode-2026-sync                works   -     DEC-2026                       mode 2026 holds frames while the host offers it
decrqm                        works   -     query.decrqm                   DECRQM reports a mode's state
da1                           works   -     query.da1                      DA1 replies
da1-level                     works   -     query.da1                      DA1 reports a level xterm defines, which the C reference did not
da2                           works   -     query.da2                      DA2 replies
da3                           works   -     query.da3                      DA3 answers DECRPTUI, where the C reference answered DA1
xtversion                     works   -     query.xtversion                XTVERSION replies with the host's text
xtgettcap                     works   -     query.xtgettcap                XTGETTCAP answers from the table; run.py skips it without the kmscon.termcap fixture
osc-4-query                   works   -     colour.palette.query           OSC 4 queries a palette colour
osc-4-set                     missing #38   colour.palette.set             OSC 4 sets a palette colour
osc-10-11-query               works   -     colour.dynamic.query           OSC 10 and 11 query the default colours
osc-10-11-set                 missing #38   colour.dynamic.set             OSC 10 and 11 set the default colours
osc-12-query                  missing #38   colour.dynamic.set             OSC 12 queries the cursor colour
osc-104-110-111-reset         missing #38   colour.palette.set             OSC 104, 110 and 111 reset what OSC 4, 10 and 11 set

# input
kitty-keyboard                missing #42   input.kitty-keyboard           the kitty keyboard protocol
modify-other-keys             works   -     input.modify-other-keys        modifyOtherKeys encodes modified keys
mouse-1000                    works   -     DEC-1000                       normal mouse tracking
mouse-1006                    works   -     DEC-1006                       SGR mouse reports
mouse-1006-first              works   -     DEC-1006                       SGR mouse reports set before tracking
mouse-1003-sgr                works   -     DEC-1003                       any-event tracking in SGR form
mouse-1003-x10                works   -     DEC-1003                       any-event tracking in the X10 form
mouse-1016                    works   -     DEC-1016                       SGR-Pixels mouse reports
bracketed-paste               works   -     DEC-2004                       a paste in mode 2004 is bracketed
focus-1004                    works   -     DEC-1004                       focus in and out reported in mode 1004

# strings vtium does not take yet
osc-8-hyperlink               missing #40   osc.8                          placeholder in the probes: OSC 8 hyperlinks
osc-52-clipboard              missing #21   osc.52.write                   placeholder in the probes: OSC 52 copy
osc-133-marks                 missing #40   osc.133                        placeholder in the probes: OSC 133 prompt marks

# images: working in a build with images and failing, as a missing probe
# must, in one without. run.py names the build feature -Dimages; vtium's is
# vtium-image (sixel #48, kitty graphics #49), and vtium builds without it
# until it lands, so the runner passes --build images=false.
sixel                         works   -Dimages image.sixel,query.xtsmgraphics DA1 attribute 4, and XTSMGRAPHICS reads the register count (#48)
kitty-graphics                works   -Dimages image.kitty                  a kitty a=q with an id gets OK (#49)
mode-80                       works   -Dimages DEC-80                       DECRQM 80 (DECSDM) replies 1 or 2 while sixel is on (#48)
mode-1070                     works   -Dimages DEC-1070                     DECRQM 1070 (private sixel registers) replies 1 or 2 (#48)
mode-8452                     works   -Dimages DEC-8452                     DECRQM 8452 (sixel cursor right) replies 1 or 2 (#48)
